        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik ma mako kwoŋ nek ma k'oŋeyere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'onwaŋere i lowo ma Rwoth Were mewin miyo win bedo mewin, del pa dhano m'oneki oriere kam'othangere, aka ŋat'oneko go k'oŋeyere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jodongo mewin kodi jothum banja mewin jolakadho kipima boro ma tindin macegin gi kama del onwaŋere i iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodongo ma tindi macegin gi del jolakwanyo roya dhiaŋ ma fodi k'otiy gine kosa k'otiŋo bieto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodongo ma tindi no jolakelo roya dhiaŋ no piny i milelo ma kicwiy, kama kifur kosa fodi k'ocwoy'iye, aka jolaturo ŋute kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocway ri Were i wi migam, nyikway Jolevi, jolabino yumalo winjo banjin mar'akaka. Kole Rwoth Were mewin otieko yero jo tic rigo kodi miyo silwany i nyingi Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodongo je ma tindi macegin gi del pa ŋat'oneki jolalwoko cingi jo kwoŋ roya dhiaŋ m'otur ŋute i milelo ma kicwiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jolawaco ni, “Cingi wan k'ooyo remo me, aka waŋ wan k'oneno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwaki ji perin Isiraili, Awi Rwoth, ji perin m'ibotho; ikir'iwey banja ma remo ma bubanja wodoŋ i dier ji perin Isiraili.” Ameno ilacwako jo i banja ma oyo remo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno apaka wilacido woko banja ma remo ma bubanja i dier win, kwoŋbedo wiripo timo gim'otire ruwaŋ Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik kwoŋ mon jojiera lweny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wikadho lweny gi jokwor mewin, aka Rwoth omiyo jo i cingi win to wimako jo paka jojiera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "k'ineno kwoŋ jojiera dhako maŋon m'igomba nywomo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilatero go peco i ot perin, aka go ripo lielo ye wiye, to ŋado lwet cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go lalunyo woko nanga pere ma jiera, to doŋ i ot perin ka ywako bamere kodi min ma dwe acel; aka rumacen, inyalo donjo bonge paka cwore, aka go labedo dhako perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'inen, go k'osangala in, inyalo weyo go kadho. Ikiripi kitana go ri pesa kosa tero go paka mukop, paka itieko riyo go nindo kodin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alunja p'okayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacwo nitie gi mon ario, omaro acel, aka k'omaro acel; ka joje jonywolo rigo wote, to okayo bedo wod pa dhako ma go k'omaro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenyo i ndelo ma go poko wote lim ma go nitie gine ri wote, go kiripi tero wod pa dhako ma go omaro paka okayo to weyo wod pa dhako ma go k'omaro, m'obedo okayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ripo yeyo wod pa dhako ma go k'omaro paka okayo, to miyo go adec ma lim pere mirundi ario, manyacik go ripo nwaŋo kwoŋbedo go obedo remo marapena ma meni pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyithindho ma jogwenyirok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dhano nitie gi wode ma jawictek aka jagwenyirok ma kiwinji dwondi bamere kosa min, makada nende jomiy go gir'acula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamere kodi min jolamako go to jotero go bongi jodongo ma tindi pere i waŋkac ma kabedo no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolawaco ri jodongo ma tindi me ni, “Wod wan me wiye tek aka jagwenyirok. Go kiwinji dwondi wan, jaworo aka jamero.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwo je ma tindi jolacadho go gi telin cuka tho. Aka Isiraili je lawinjo, to jobedo gi bwok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dhano otimo banja ma gir'acula ma tho, t'iŋawo go wi yath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "del pere kiripi weyo wonindi wi yath; wiripo yiko go i ndelo no won, kwoŋbedo ŋat'oŋaw wi yath nitie i lam pa Were. Wikiripi koco lowo ma Rwoth Were mewin miyo win wobedi mewin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.21.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
